      "id": "claim_50d5f754af2648b1a22070a9b6535576",
      "statement": "The build has three route families: shared OSS source can emit `/oss/python/...` and `/oss/javascript/...` routes according to language navigation, OpenWiki and Deep Agents Code emit one unversioned OSS route each, and ordinary LangSmith content emits `/langsmith/...`; direct `managed-deep-agents*.mdx` files are the LangSmith exception and emit both language routes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://pipeline/core/builder.py#L431-L453",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bf8cec63fd5e008403317bee5f1b527f60de7fa8ac1d7d4564796ef77fcc211d:"
